# Flathub applications to pre-install into the generated ISO.
#
# One Flathub application ID per line; blank lines and lines starting with
# "#" are ignored. When this list has at least one entry, "make iso" builds an
# extra flatpak-$ARCH.squashfs module holding the applications and their
# runtimes, and scripts/make_config_ini adds that module to MODULES= so
# scripts/make_iso ships it. An empty list changes nothing.
#
# The applications are downloaded during the build, so they are present on the
# ISO and work with no network on first boot. They are not small: each one adds
# hundreds of megabytes to several gigabytes once its runtime is counted.
#
# The web build manager (webui/) rewrites this file inside its own private
# per-job snapshot; editing it here only affects command-line "make" builds.
#
# Example:
# com.github.tchx84.Flatseal
# org.videolan.VLC
